title Cassette (deck, 640x480 at 11.3 px/mm): trim and split, steppers and keys of the toolkit touch target, the waveform takes the rest
sizes 640x480
ppmm 1130
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_PAGE trim
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
shot deck-trim
expect text "REMOVE"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
